  <p class=note id=defnote></p>
</div>

<div class=card>
  <div class=row><label>Brightness</label>
    <input type=range id=s_brightness min=0 max=100 step=1>
    <span class=val><input id=n_brightness inputmode=numeric></span></div>
  <div class=row><label>Contrast</label>
    <input type=range id=s_contrast min=0 max=100 step=1>
    <span class=val><input id=n_contrast inputmode=numeric></span></div>
  <p class=note>These two are independent and do read back correctly. Contrast on this panel is a digital multiplier &mdash; high values clip highlights.</p>
</div>

<div class=card>
  <div class=bar>
    <button class=p onclick=reapply()>Re-apply</button>
    <button onclick=factory()>Factory values</button>
    <button onclick=reset()>Reset panel + User&nbsp;1</button>
  </div>
  <p class=note><b>Reset panel</b> clears the latched state where the monitor silently ignores every write. Use it if changes stop having any effect at all.</p>
</div>

<div class=card>
  <div class=bar>
    <input type=text id=pname placeholder="profile name">
    <button onclick=saveP()>Save</button>
    <select id=psel onchange=loadP()><option value="">load profile&hellip;</option></select>
    <button onclick=delP()>Delete</button>
  </div>
